+### Source-reported filing fiscal focus
+
+For registered replay10-Q/10-K originals, normal `search_documents` and `read_document` may attach `source_metadata` evidence with `record_type=inline_dei_fiscal_focus` and `data.fiscal_period_contexts`. It reports original DEI DocumentFiscalYearFocus/DocumentFiscalPeriodFocus/DocumentPeriodEndDate after checking the shared primary inline-XBRL context, SEC CIK, registered issuer/form and report end. Original node text/locators and the context's YTD or instant period remain inspectable. The fiscal year is reported, never inferred from a calendar date or filename.
