+This is filing-level metadata, not a monetary operand, not a derived quarter start, and not an automatic label for historical comparison columns or segment tables. Missing/ambiguous contexts, incompatible issuer/date, or unproved DEI facts abstain. Existing SEC financial facts retain their context-only `fiscal_period_context`; exact dates still select observations. Saved filing-focus metadata is revalidated from original source bytes before reuse on a new turn.
